    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Richard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present this one bedroom to the property market.\r\n\r\nSmithfield Market is a highly sought-after development ideally located in the heart of Dublin 7, offering residents a vibrant city lifestyle with every amenity on their doorstep. This spacious one-bedroom apartment comes complete with a designated parking space and a private balcony, making it an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright and well-proportioned throughout, briefly comprising an entrance hallway leading to a large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The contemporary kitchen is fitted with an abundance of both base and eye-level units, providing excellent storage, while granite countertops add a sleek and modern finish. The generous living and dining space is flooded with natural light and enjoys direct access to the private balcony, creating an ideal setting for relaxing or entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nThe spacious double bedroom also benefits from direct access to the balcony and features fitted wardrobes, providing ample storage space. A large family bathroom, finished to a high standard with quality sanitary ware, completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nSmithfield Market is a well-maintained and professionally managed development that has become one of Dublin's most desirable residential addresses. Residents benefit from secure access and beautifully maintained communal areas, while the surrounding neighbourhood offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, supermarkets and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with the Luas Red Line just a short stroll away, providing easy access to the city centre, Heuston Station and beyond. Numerous Dublin Bus routes serve the area, while the city centre is within walking distance. Popular landmarks including Smithfield Square, the Jameson Distillery, the Four Courts, Phoenix Park and TU Dublin Grangegorman campus are all easily accessible, further enhancing the appeal of this superb property.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, modern finishes, excellent transport links and a prime city location, this attractive apartment is sure to generate significant interest from discerning purchasers seeking a stylish home or investment opportunity in the heart of Dublin.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
